    groups: 3 distinct crop signatures — 2 repeated pairs + 1 unique singleton
    bbox_crop: 1-5 rows x 1-3 cols, area 3-6 fg pixels per sprite
    colors_per_sprite: 1-2 distinct non-bg colors
    color_overlap: colors MAY be shared across groups (not required to be disjoint)
